<section aria-labelledby="accountTitle" aria-modal="true" class="modal compact-modal" hidden="" id="accountModal" role="dialog">
<button class="modal-close icon-button" data-close-modal="" type="button"><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/xmark.svg"/></button>
<div class="modal-heading"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/user.svg"/></span><div><h2 id="accountTitle">Welcome back</h2><p>Sign in to view orders, saved items and recommendations.</p></div></div>
<div class="stack-form" id="loginForm"><a class="button button-primary" href="/login">Sign In Securely</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/signup">Create Account</a></div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="locationTitle" aria-modal="true" class="modal compact-modal" hidden="" id="locationModal" role="dialog">
<button class="modal-close icon-button" data-close-modal="" type="button"><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/xmark.svg"/></button>
<div class="modal-heading"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/location-dot.svg"/></span><div><h2 id="locationTitle">Choose delivery location</h2><p>We’ll use this to estimate delivery availability.</p></div></div>
<form class="stack-form" id="locationForm"><label>Delivery city<input id="locationInput" placeholder="e.g. Kampala" required="" minlength="2" maxlength="120" type="text" value="<%= deliveryCity || '' %>"/></label><small>Country is controlled separately. Classic Mart validates this city against configured delivery zones; final fees are recalculated at checkout.</small><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Save Location</button><p class="form-status" id="locationStatus" role="status"></p></form>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="trackTitle" aria-modal="true" class="modal compact-modal" hidden="" id="trackModal" role="dialog">
<button class="modal-close icon-button" data-close-modal="" type="button"><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/xmark.svg"/></button>
<div class="modal-heading"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/box.svg"/></span><div><h2 id="trackTitle">Track your order</h2><p>Enter an order number to view its latest status.</p></div></div>
<form action="/track-order" class="stack-form" id="trackForm" method="get"><label>Order number<input id="trackInput" name="order" placeholder="e.g. ord_..." required="" type="text"/></label><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Track Order</button></form>
<div class="track-result" hidden="" id="trackResult"></div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="helpTitle" aria-modal="true" class="modal compact-modal" hidden="" id="helpModal" role="dialog">
<button class="modal-close icon-button" data-close-modal="" type="button"><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/xmark.svg"/></button>
<div class="modal-heading"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/headset.svg"/></span><div><h2 id="helpTitle">How can we help?</h2><p>Choose a support option and send your message.</p></div></div>
<div class="stack-form" id="helpForm"><p>Support requests are submitted through the protected Help Center so your contact details, order reference and SLA queue are handled by the server.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/help">Open Help Center</a></div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="sellerTitle" aria-modal="true" class="modal compact-modal" hidden="" id="sellerModal" role="dialog">
<button class="modal-close icon-button" data-close-modal="" type="button"><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/xmark.svg"/></button>
<div class="modal-heading"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/store.svg"/></span><div><h2 id="sellerTitle">Start selling on Classic Mart</h2><p>Create a storefront, list products and manage orders.</p></div></div>
<div class="stack-form" id="sellerForm"><p>Seller details, identity verification and business information are collected in the secure onboarding workflow.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/onboarding?role=seller">Start Seller Onboarding</a></div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="checkoutTitle" aria-modal="true" class="modal compact-modal" hidden="" id="checkoutModal" role="dialog">
<button class="modal-close icon-button" data-close-modal="" type="button"><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/xmark.svg"/></button>
<div class="modal-heading"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/credit-card.svg"/></span><div><h2 id="checkoutTitle">Secure checkout</h2><p>Review the server-calculated order and continue to the configured payment method.</p></div></div>
<form class="stack-form" id="checkoutForm"><p>Checkout is handled on the secure server cart page. Classic Mart does not collect raw card details in this storefront dialog.</p><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Continue to secure checkout</button></form>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="contentModalTitle" aria-modal="true" class="modal information-modal" hidden="" id="contentModal" role="dialog">
<button class="modal-close icon-button" data-close-modal="" type="button"><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/xmark.svg"/></button>
<div id="contentModalBody"></div>
</section>
<section aria-hidden="true" class="filter-drawer" id="filterDrawer">
<div class="drawer-header"><div><h2>Filter Products</h2><p>Refine the trending selection</p></div><button class="icon-button" id="closeFilter" type="button"><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/xmark.svg"/></button></div>
<form id="filterForm">
<fieldset id="homepageFilterCategories"><legend>Category</legend><label><input checked="" name="filterCategory" type="radio" value="all"/> All categories</label><label><input name="filterCategory" type="radio" value="electronics"/> Electronics</label><label><input name="filterCategory" type="radio" value="fashion"/> Fashion</label><label><input name="filterCategory" type="radio" value="home"/> Home &amp; Kitchen</label><label><input name="filterCategory" type="radio" value="beauty"/> Beauty &amp; Health</label></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Maximum price</legend><input id="priceRange" max="1" min="0" type="range" value="1"/><output id="priceOutput">Loading prices…</output></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Sort by</legend><select id="sortSelect"><option value="featured">Featured</option><option value="price-asc">Price: Low to High</option><option value="price-desc">Price: High to Low</option><option value="rating">Customer Rating</option></select></fieldset>
<button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Apply Filters</button><button class="button button-secondary" id="resetFilters" type="button">Reset</button>
</form>
</section>
